cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use EBGeometry in published work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "EBGeometry"
abstract: >-
  A header-only C++17 library for fast, portable geometry queries on CPUs and GPUs: signed distance
  functions of surface meshes, analytic shapes and constructive solid geometry, accelerated by bounding
  volume hierarchies, with ray queries and point clouds, for embedded-boundary codes and beyond.
authors:
  - family-names: Marskar
    given-names: Robert
    affiliation: SINTEF
license: BSD-3-Clause
repository-code: "https://github.com/rmrsk/EBGeometry"
url: "https://rmrsk.github.io/EBGeometry/"
keywords:
  - signed distance functions
  - constructive solid geometry
  - bounding volume hierarchy
  - embedded boundary
  - GPU
  - C++
